# @name: sed-awk | Substitute in Range of Lines
# @description: Replaces text in a range of lines Group: Sed Pattern Matching and Substitution. Template: replace placeholders before running. {start} = Starting line number [default "1"] | {end} = Ending line number [default "10"] | {old_text} = Text to replace | {new_text} = Replacement text | {file} = Path to the file
sed '{start},{end}s/{old_text}/{new_text}/g' {file}